Mutations against scripts/avatar/springsim.grid.test.ts, 2026-09-11.

Baseline: the fix in place, 8 tests, exit 0.
Each mutation is applied to scripts/avatar/springsim.ts on its own, the suite is
run, and the file is restored by writing back the bytes read before the first
mutation (never `git checkout --`; the byte comparison is asserted after every
restore and again at the end). node_modules/.vite is removed before every run.

Eleven mutations, eleven red. The named tests under each are the ones that
failed; a mutation that broke only wasted work rather than the answer would show
as STILL GREEN and is called out where it happened.
