M8's first draft was an EQUIVALENT mutation, not a hole in the tests. It moved
the prefix sum's start from `c = 0` to `c = 1`, and `start[0]` is always 0
because the counting pass only ever increments `start[cell + 1]`, so the
skipped iteration was `start[1] += 0`. It stayed green because nothing had
changed. It was replaced by two mutations that do change the answer:

